      "post_subject": "Pulsed DCG holography",
      "content_md": "Hi.\n\nYesterday I've tried G307 with YAGna.\n\nIt seems that to make a Denisuyk of a dice (1,5cm on a side) 1 pulse 4-5mJ is enough \n\nThere are parts of the dice visible on 2 out of 6 plates (each plate exposed with different energy). \"Slightly\" brighter than on VRP-Ms \n\nAnyway, first try - first small success.\n\nThanks Jeff \n\ngreetings\n\nAdam",
